-- words --
A model that breaks a rule exits as today: a Goal's model whose own behaviour breaks its checked rule Positive; the tool exits 1 and says nothing about hyp select.
-- run --
skills/hyp-statechart/scripts/statechart goals/G-ONE/specs/count.tla --config goals/G-ONE/specs/count.cfg --out out 2>&1; echo "tool exit: $?"
-- floor: contains --
